      Save Image
    </button>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="footer">
  <p>&#9769; &nbsp; Daily Verse &middot; Retreat 2026 &middot; St. George Brooklyn &nbsp; &#9769;</p>
</div>

<div class="toast" id="toast"></div>

